摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Turn DeepSeek Harness articles into editable Excalidraw canvases — live diagrams, not disposable Mermaid output.","id":"gh:1334828681","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-diagram","slug":"hanzhangzzz/dsh-diagram","topics":["canvas","deepseek-harness","diagram","diagram-editor","dsh","dsh-bundle","dsh-plugin","excalidraw","flowchart","visualization","web-ui"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Turn DeepSeek Harness articles into editable Excalidraw canvases — live diagrams, not disposable Mer"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"k Harness articles into editable Excalidraw canvases — live diagrams, not disposable Mermaid output."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-diagram"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-diagram) [](https://github.com/hanzhangzzz/dsh-diagram/releases"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"/latest) [](./LICENSE) [](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness)"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**Turn an article you have read in DSH into a diagram you can keep editing, saving, and exporting.**"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"A canvas plugin for DeepSeek Harness (DSH) Desktop and Web. The Agent drafts the structure; you refi"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ne text and layout in Excalidraw inside the same session, without rebuilding the result in another a"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"text and layout in Excalidraw inside the same session, without rebuilding the result in another app."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"**In DeepSeek Harness Desktop** (recommended): open **Plugins** → **Add plugin**, enter the package "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"below, click **Install**, then **Enable now**."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Using DSH Web from a terminal instead? Run `npx -y @deepseek-ai/dsh@0.1.7-rc.2 plugin --profile web "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"add dsh-diagram@0.6.1`. Details: Quick install."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"**dsh-diagram 0.5.0 · real DSH recording (Chinese UI).** Cropped close-ups of editing, saving, and a"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"n actual export; model-generation waiting is not shown."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"**The whole loop in 30 seconds (0.6.1, with sound):** draft from the conversation → fix labels by ha"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"nd → the Agent reads your edited version → export PNG/SVG/`.excalidraw`. Product frames are real rec"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"ordings and exports; the animation around them is illustration."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e0930087-f841-48af-84ea-fa39267f85b0"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Try one complete workflow"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"After **Enable now** in Desktop (or restarting DSH Web), put an article in a session, type `/` and s"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"elect **canvas-diagram**, then send:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Why keep the diagram in DSH?"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- **Reuse the article context.** Ask the Agent to organize content already in the conversation. The "},{"id":"p18s2","text":"plugin itself does not fetch webpages.\n- **Keep editing after generation.** Change labels, nodes, an"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"d layout in Excalidraw, with autosave in the current session.\n- **Take the result with you.** Export"},{"id":"p18s4","text":" PNG/SVG for sharing or `.excalidraw` for further editing. Ask the Agent to read the canvas when you"},{"id":"p18s5","text":" want it to incorporate your manual changes."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## What it adds"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Surface | Behavior |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| `diagram_create` | Creates a diagram for the current Agent Session from a compact semantic specifi"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"cation. `visualStyle: \"sketchnote\"` selects the optional hand-drawn compiler; controlled `icon` valu"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"es compile to editable native primitives rather than images. |\n| `diagram_read` | Reads a bounded su"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"mmary of the current editable scene into the conversation transcript. |\n| `canvas-diagram` skill | B"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"uilt-in bilingual routing entry: selectable from the composer's `/` menu and matched by generic diag"},{"id":"p21s6","text":"ram requests, so the Agent reaches `diagram_create` without exact tool-name prompts. |\n| Inline chat"},{"id":"p21s7","text":" preview | After `diagram_create`, a preview card appears in the conversation flow and always render"},{"id":"p21s8","text":"s the diagram's current content — including later canvas edits — as a static SVG. |\n| **Canvas** tab"},{"id":"p21s9","text":" | Opens the Excalidraw editor only when selected, keeping it out of the normal chat startup path. |"},{"id":"p21s10","text":"\n| Diagram list | Switches between diagrams; collapses on desktop and becomes a selector on narrow s"},{"id":"p21s11","text":"creens. |\n| Autosave | Debounced durable writes with revision conflict protection and tab-local pend"},{"id":"p21s12","text":"ing-draft recovery. |\n| Export | Downloads `.excalidraw`, SVG, or PNG files. |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"The plugin does not fetch articles and does not inject UI into arbitrary websites. Article acquisiti"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"on stays with the DSH conversation, file tools, or Web tools."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| Item | Supported in `0.6.1` |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| DeepSeek Harness Desktop | `0.1.7-rc.2` (macOS Apple Silicon verified; Windows x64 not yet tested)"},{"id":"p25s2","text":" |\n| DeepSeek Harness Web | `0.1.7-rc.2`, `0.1.5-rc.1`, `0.1.5-rc.2`, `0.1.2-rc.1` (older DSH: use `"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"dsh-diagram@0.4.0`) |\n| Profile | `desktop` (managed on the Plugins page) or `web` |\n| Web bind addr"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"ess | `127.0.0.1` only (Desktop's own Host already uses loopback) |\n| Node.js | `^22.19.0` or `>=24."},{"id":"p25s5","text":"0.0` |\n| Editor | Excalidraw `0.18.1` |\n| Storage | Plugin-owned DSH storage-domain sidecar |\n| Inst"},{"id":"p25s6","text":"all artifact | Prebuilt npm package or GitHub Release tarball with SHA-256 checksum |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"The npm package has no install lifecycle scripts. Installation adds a bundle to the selected DSH pro"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"file; it does not compile code or modify the DeepSeek Harness source tree."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Data, security, and limits"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- The Excalidraw scene is the current document. The original semantic specification is retained only"},{"id":"p28s2","text":" as its creation source.\n- A diagram is bound to its Session id and `{createdAt, cwd}` lifecycle fin"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"gerprint. A reused Session id cannot read older data.\n- Session fork and Session export do not copy "},{"id":"p28s4","text":"or include diagram sidecar data.\n- Editor assets and fonts are self-hosted by the bundle; the canvas"},{"id":"p28s5","text":" does not depend on an external CDN.\n- Static paths, RPC bodies, request origin, Session ownership, "},{"id":"p28s6","text":"and scene contents are validated by the Host before persistence.\n- Images, iframes, embeddables, ext"},{"id":"p28s7","text":"ernal links, and non-empty binary files are rejected in this release.\n- Defaults limit each scene to"},{"id":"p28s8","text":" 1 MiB and all stored diagram records to 64 MiB. Element, text, diagram-count, and byte limits are e"},{"id":"p28s9","text":"xplicit in `cordis.patch.yml`.\n- The plugin intentionally refuses to load when DSH Web binds to `0.0"},{"id":"p28s10","text":".0.0`; this release does not expose the canvas RPC to a LAN."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"### Desktop says \"dsh-diagram@0.6.0 is incompatible with DSH 0.1.7-rc.2\""},{"id":"p30s1","text":"The package manager picked an older release. Add the plugin again as `dsh-diagram@0.6.1`, with the v"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"ersion. If your Desktop is `0.1.7-rc.1`, update the app to `0.1.7-rc.2` first."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"### Why does startup fail with `0.0.0.0`?"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"The canvas RPC is not designed for LAN exposure in this release. The plugin fails closed unless DSH "},{"id":"p32s2","text":"Web is physically bound to `127.0.0.1`."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"### What should I do after a revision conflict?"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"The editor keeps the local draft. Export it before choosing **Reload server version** if you need to"},{"id":"p34s2","text":" preserve both versions."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"### Why can SVG export log a font fallback warning?"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Under the strict content security policy, Excalidraw may fall back from glyph subsetting to embeddin"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"g the full self-hosted font. The exported SVG remains self-contained; the plugin does not enable `un"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"safe-eval` to suppress the warning."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
